    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "And we appreciate your serving on that committee. Of course, your influence, you do have influence there, but with democratic leadership, it is limited. You sounded optimistic a moment ago about Republicans taking over the Congress, the majority in Congress. What, since you brought that up, what insights are you seeing or what leads you to believe that that's going to happen?",
